
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Riverbend Yoga Studio | Services</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>Our Yoga Services</h1>
    <p>Find a class that works for you.</p>
</header>

<nav>
    <a href="index.html">Home</a>
    <a href="services.html">Services</a>
    <a href="about.html">About</a>
    <a href="events.html">Events</a>
</nav>

<main>
    <section>
        <h2>Our Classes</h2>
        <p>Riverbend Yoga Studio offers different classes for people with different goals and experience levels. Whether you are new to yoga or have practiced for years, we have a class for you.</p>

        <img src="images/yoga-instructor.jpg" alt="Yoga instructor demonstrating a yoga pose">

        <h3>Beginner Yoga</h3>
        <p>This class introduces basic yoga poses and breathing exercises. It is a great choice for people who are new to yoga.</p>

        <h3>Gentle Yoga</h3>
        <p>Gentle yoga uses slow movements and simple poses to help students relax and improve flexibility.</p>

        <h3>Vinyasa Yoga</h3>
        <p>Vinyasa connects movement with breathing. This class helps students build strength, balance, and flexibility.</p>

        <h3>Restorative Yoga</h3>
        <p>Restorative yoga focuses on relaxation. Students use comfortable positions and slow breathing to release stress.</p>

        <h3>Private Instruction</h3>
        <p>Private sessions provide one-on-one support for students who want personal guidance and a practice that fits their goals.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>Choose the Right Class</h2>
        <img src="images/yoga-workshop.jpg" alt="Students practicing yoga together in a group">
        <p>If you are not sure which class to choose, contact us or visit our Events page to learn about workshops.</p>
        <a class="button-link" href="events.html">View Upcoming Events</a>
    </section>
</main>

<footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 Riverbend Yoga Studio. All rights reserved.</p>
</footer>

